o  First aid

	 Emergency procedures

o  Fire drill
o  Evacuation

	 Equipment considerations

□

o  Fit for purpose
o  Safety checked
o  Reporting system for damage
o  Risk assessed

 Safety measures
	 Displaying a fire safety notice
	 Using warning signs
o  A ‘wet floor’ sign
o  ‘No entry’ sign

To include:

•	 The importance of the procedures and measures.
•	 How they protect service providers and service
users in different types of health and social care
