7.3  Entry rules, including Terminal Assessment

Terminal assessment rule

The externally assessed unit must be taken as terminal
assessment. This means the exam for unit R032 must
be taken in the student’s final assessment series which
could be in January or June. This exam contributes 40%
of the total marks available for the qualification.

NEA units can be submitted in any series but must be
submitted either before or in the same series as the
externally assessed unit.

Certification entries
