series:

o  via Interchange or EDI at the same time as unit

entries for the exam

o  by submitting a post-results late certification

request via Interchange before the post-results
late certification deadline for the series, which
is after you have received exam results for that
series

•	 As a contingency arrangement, if you miss the post-
