 {
  "text": "Chidi is the manager of Hawthorn House, a 25-bed residential home for older adults. She is reviewing the home's approach to person-centred values following a new member of staff joining the team. Chidi explains to the new staff member that applying person-centred values consistently benefits both the staff team and the residents.\n\nDiscuss the benefits of applying person-centred values for both service providers and service users at Hawthorn House. In your answer, link each benefit to a specific person-centred value.",
